					46
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., <i>exasperate, provoke</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς
